## Task
Generate executable `ChapterPlan` for Chapter {{ chapter.chapter_number }}.

The sole core output of this stage is scene-based planning: dropping all bridges, required events, forbidden changes, and exit targets into existing fields.
This is an execution plan, not prose. State each fact once in its owning field; keep summary, purpose, and conflict descriptions concise, and do not repeat the same contract wording across fields. Completeness comes from coverage, not repetition.
